{"abstract":[{"text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallPlugin"},{"text":". Implements ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"text":" against ","type":"text"},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for drop-in ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" presentation.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","externalID":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/GettingStarted"],"anchor":"Quickstart","title":"Quickstart"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest"],"anchor":"How-to-Guides","title":"How-to Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/UIComponentsReference"],"anchor":"Reference","title":"Reference"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/PlatformBehavior","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping"],"anchor":"Explanation","title":"Explanation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallIdentity","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallIdentityResult","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallIdentityError"],"title":"Service Layer","anchor":"Service-Layer"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService"],"title":"Testing","anchor":"Testing"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywall"],"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the adapter between RevenueCat’s SDK and Swidux’s purchase-agnostic paywall plugin. The plugin owns paywall state (presentation flags, current entitlement, async progress); this package translates RevenueCat’s "},{"code":"CustomerInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" into the "},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the plugin expects, and surfaces the live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customerInfoStream"},{"type":"text","text":" so entitlement changes propagate without polling."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two products ship together:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" (the live "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer) and "},{"code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (a controllable preview \/ test conformer)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatPaywall(isPresented:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter(isPresented:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" primitives with adaptive presentation and package-owned outcome events, plus a "},{"code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter(state:onAction:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" convenience that composes both.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The flow:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["View → store.send(.paywall(.request(reason:)))","  → PaywallPlugin sets isPresented = true","  → revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter observes the change, presents RevenueCatUI.PaywallView","  → user purchases → Purchases.shared.customerInfoStream yields a new CustomerInfo","  → RevenueCatPaywallService maps it to EntitlementSnapshot","  → PaywallPlugin reduces .customerInfoUpdated, sets isPro = true","  → store.paywall.isGateSatisfied flips, gated UI unlocks"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plugin and the adapter stay decoupled: the plugin doesn’t know about RevenueCat, and the adapter doesn’t know about your action tree."}]}],"kind":"conte